    ],
    "summary" : "The multimedia discipline: say what is playing, drive the transport, play a playlist, and find a song in the Apple Music catalog. An application joins this discipline by declaring a `mediaSurface` — where its transport and library live — which is what lets Mary read and drive it without naming it in Swift. RATINGS AND LIBRARY SEARCH ARE STILL OUT: they were Apple Events in the plugin this descends from, and Mary sends none. Playlists were assumed to be in that group and are not — the sidebar is an ordinary Accessibility outline.",
